+Show the App Configuration
+--------------------------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command will show the loaded
+application's configuration as JSON. Values of keys that contain ``SECRET``,
+``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` are masked with ``***`` to avoid exposing
+sensitive data. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "APPLICATION_ROOT": "/",
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "MY_SECRET": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
